@@ -4,6 +4,12 @@ The Node 24 LTS connector collects exact aggregate token counters from supported
 sources and pairs them with Vibe Racing agent accounts. It never uploads raw sessions or local
 paths.
 
+The connector protocol module validates response size, content type, JSON shape, terminal safety,
+and endpoint-specific fields before trusting a response. A valid non-success response rejects with
+an `Error` carrying its HTTP `status` and validated server `code`; malformed or unsafe responses
+use `invalid_server_response` instead. The CLI uses those fields for the existing pairing,
+reconciliation, and usage-sync cleanup and retry rules.
+
 ```bash
 npx --yes --prefer-online --package https://viberacing.example/downloads/viberacing-connector.tgz -- \
   viberacing connect --origin https://viberacing.example
